# The Wandering Minstrel: "At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control five or more Towns" makes a 2/2
# all-colors Elemental (CR 603.4), and {3}{W}{U}{B}{R}{G} gives other creatures you control +X/+X, X the Towns you control.
# Bot1 plays a Forest (a land, not a Town) on turn 1 and a Capital City (a Town) each turn after: four Cities on turn 9 make
# no token though Bot1 has five lands, the fifth on turn 11 makes one, and Bot2's turn 12 (five Towns, not Bot1's combat) makes none. Bot2's Capital City (a Town it controls, turn 2) is never counted:
# with it Bot1's four are five Towns in all, still no token, and X stays 5, not 6.
# The five Moxen and three Cities pay the pump: the token is 2/2 + 5, not the Minstrel ("other") nor Bot2's Woodland Changeling.

